 * FEAT-2PZQKJ / TASK-3T3NSV — schema-driven generic address renderer (Hyva).
 * Serves as the `schema` mode of address/general/renderer; the legacy template
 * (hyva/address/edit.phtml) remains the default until per-store cutover.
 *
 * Differences from the legacy template — by design:
 * - Region label/required/placeholder and every city level (label, placeholder, required,
 *   ordering, COUNT of levels) come from the resolved Address Profile via GraphQL
 *   `addressSchema` — never from depth, never hard-coded, never country-conditioned.
 * - Cascade options come from `addressLocations` (ID-canonical; select state carries city_id).
 * - The posted `city` value remains the leaf default_name (display/back-compat with validators
 *   + carriers); the canonical ids travel in address_city_id / address_location_path.
 * - No sub_city field: deeper levels are city levels of the recursive hierarchy.
 *
 * Everything else (contact fields, street, VAT, postcode/telephone validation rules,
 * default billing/shipping, region handling) is ported 1:1 from the legacy template.
 */

